<title>NETHERLANDS: ATHLETICS-CASTRO OF PORTUGAL WINS ROTTERDAM MARATHON.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-CASTRO OF PORTUGAL WINS ROTTERDAM MARATHON.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Domingos Castro of Portugal won the Rotterdam Marathon on Sunday in an unofficial time of two hours seven minutes 50 seconds.</p>
<p>Alejandro Gomes of Spain was second and Sammy Korir of Kenya finished third.  </p>
<p>Castro's winning time was later officially adjusted to 2:07.51.</p>
